// https://github.com/opendata-nuernberg/molekula at
// 78ca099e9eb3d10618639eec493a3c0454c9b470 (MIT). Values are copied
// unchanged: millimetres, y up, rotation in degrees counterclockwise.
// Key indexes follow the firmware `pin_mappings` of
// my_keyboards/molekula/main.zig; each designator was matched through the
// PCB nets (switch column, diode row). SW37 (reset) and SW38 (encoder) are
// not keys.
